Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.58,0:01:17.15,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,There are two ways\Nto prolong life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:24.90,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,One is watching movies,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.47,0:01:29.48,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:31.81,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,The target has entered\Nself-protection mode again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:41.75,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,The other is becoming\Na memory collector.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:47.31,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,BUG Man No. 55 located.\NPrepare the extraction container.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.31,0:01:48.44,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,Yes, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.52,0:01:53.19,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,However, since it isn't\Nhiring season right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.64,0:01:58.22,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,I won't go into the benefits of\Nbecoming a memory collector just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.21,0:02:00.83,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,What I want to talk about today
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.83,0:02:04.29,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,is the incident commonly used\Nto educate newcomers like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:06.23,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Breakout of Shi Yan."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.77,0:03:03.71,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,This was extracted\Nfrom the BUG Source's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:06.60,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,The exclusive container for Shi Yan,\NBUG Man No. 55.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:10.42,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Now, we'll use this\Nto recycle him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.42,0:03:12.48,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Your name is…\NBai {\i1}Chong{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:13.56,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,Bai {\i1}Zhong{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:15.93,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Oh, Bai Zhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.93,0:03:18.99,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Your former supervisor told me\Nyou're a hard worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.99,0:03:21.40,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Anyway, you'll be interning\Nunder me from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:22.74,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,My name is Fang Tang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.52,0:03:25.27,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,This is the Memory Recycling Depot,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:27.23,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,a unit under\NThe Memory Administration Bureau.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:30.92,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Everything piled up here\Nis a discarded memory entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.92,0:03:35.25,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,But the work here is mostly physical labor;\Nrecycling, sorting, and the like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:37.32,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,It's been years\Nsince we last had an intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.79,0:03:39.94,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Although the work\Nin our department is simple,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.94,0:03:41.61,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,emergencies happen all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.61,0:03:43.27,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,So let me emphasize\Nthe key points again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:45.88,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,We have two main tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.88,0:03:48.71,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,The first is extracting\Nexcess ordinary memories from organisms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:51.44,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Although the human brain's\Nstorage limit is still unclear,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:54.33,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,humanity is always searching\Nfor more efficient ways to store things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:57.27,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,And this Memory Extractor I just used,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:03:59.57,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,is an auxiliary tool\Ndeveloped by our bureau.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.65,0:04:02.04,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Under normal circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:05.58,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,it automatically purges minor memories\Nto make space for new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.88,0:04:10.29,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Of course, if the extracted memories\Nare destroyed here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:11.65,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,they will disappear forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.01,0:04:15.92,italics,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Is she actually listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:19.82,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Our second task is recycling these…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:20.85,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,BUG Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.58,0:04:22.52,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,In the past decade,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.52,0:04:24.96,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,violent incidents involving BUG Men\Nhave been on the rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:27.33,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Their exact origins remain unknown,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.33,0:04:29.21,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,but the current prevailing theory is…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.21,0:04:32.21,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,BUG Men originate from the memories\Nof individuals with a special constitution,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.21,0:04:35.06,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,materialized by the intense emotions\Nattached to those memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:37.83,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Generally, we call these individuals\N"BUG Sources."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.33,0:04:41.15,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,We usually start with the BUG Sources\Nto interfere with the BUG Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.15,0:04:44.39,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,There are 93 BUG Men on record so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.60,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,They all cause some degree of chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.13,0:04:51.00,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,For example, stewing people's unrelated memories\Ntogether like crossed cables.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:51.00,top,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stew{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.85,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Or causing intense déjà vu,\Nblurring the line between real and fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:55.81,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,In extreme cases,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:04:59.79,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,the entire trajectory of a person's life\Ncould be unpredictably altered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:01.03,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,You should already know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:04.21,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Fortunately, we've successfully\Nrecycled most of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.21,0:05:08.50,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Shi Yan, who originated from this BUG Source,\Nis one of the few remaining BUG Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:10.79,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Dealing with him on your first day\Nmight be a bit of a handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:12.25,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,But just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:15.75,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Hm, his vitals are stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:18.71,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Bai Zhong,\Npull down that lever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.40,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,We're officially starting\Nthe recycling process.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:21.73,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Not so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:31.50,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Ever since I was young,\NI was always bullied.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.21,0:05:33.37,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,I hated conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.79,0:05:37.04,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,I never understood why people\Nalways targeted and picked on me…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:40.54,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,…until Shi Yan appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:43.33,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,With him around,\Nmy life gradually became easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:04.07,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Fortunately, we ended up at the same school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:07.87,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Whenever I was bullied,\Nhe'd always show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:13.53,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Shi Yan isn't very tall,\Nbut he sure can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:16.34,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,He's always running around outside,\Nso he's perpetually tanned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:18.35,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,I don't like sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.35,0:06:20.08,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,I still remember one of my birthdays…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:24.00,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,he actually devoured all the cake\Nmy family prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:27.16,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,He was also the one who taught me\Nhow to ride a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:29.92,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,After that,\Nwe'd often go biking together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.08,0:06:34.12,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Shi Yan is always so carefree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:37.95,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,I never really know\Nwhat's going on in his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.00,0:06:55.58,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,But he's always been\Nthe kind of person I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:58.44,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,He's straightforward and decisive,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:00.81,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,he never hesitates when doing things,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:02.10,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,and I've never seen him scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:07.08,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Time and time again,\Nhe saved me from misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.79,0:07:09.89,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Eventually,\Nas long as he was around,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:12.60,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,no one dared to bully me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:17.96,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,He seemed to have boundless time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:22.19,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Whenever we hung out,\Nhe always made time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.09,0:07:25.88,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Even though there wasn't\Nmuch to do in the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:29.19,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,killing time together\Nwas always incredibly fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:36.68,main,NANZHU,0,0,0,,The weekend flies by so fast,\NI'll really don't want to go to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:38.58,main,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Classes drag on forever…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:44.52,main,NANZHU,0,0,0,,But if you think about it,\Nlife as a whole goes by pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.08,0:07:49.02,main,NANZHU,0,0,0,,If we live to be 70, we've already\Nburned through almost a quarter of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:52.67,main,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Thinking about it like that\Nis actually kind of terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.13,0:07:54.85,main,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Ah, look—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:09.85,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Bai Zhong,\Nstep back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.85,0:08:11.92,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,He's been heavily enhanced\Nby the BUG Source!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:35.85,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,Huh? That's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.85,0:09:37.17,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,This anesthetic\Nisn't working at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:39.77,main,NANZHU,0,0,0,,You look kind of familiar…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:39.77,top,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:41.39,main,NANZHU,0,0,0,,My head hurts…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:43.04,main,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.04,0:09:46.54,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with your brain,\Nwe're treating it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.42,0:09:46.54,top,NANZHU,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:48.42,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,My boss is arresting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:51.33,main,NANZHU,0,0,0,,What?\NJust tell me where I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.33,0:09:53.48,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,I just started here,\Nso I can't really explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:56.42,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,Simply put, he's a BUG Man\Ncreated by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:59.13,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,By frequently slipping into reality\Nand messing with your memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:02.15,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,he's highly likely to become a major threat,\Nwhich is why he's being arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:02.15,top,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Speak slowly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:05.43,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,To sum it up, the '{\i1}him{\i0}' in reality\Nno longer exists,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.43,0:10:08.00,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,yet you forcibly materialized him\Nfrom your own memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:11.59,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,Still, it's pretty amazing that…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:16.73,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,a timid BUG Source like you\Nmanaged to manifest such a powerful BUG Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:21.74,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,The most crucial moments in life\Nare defined by just a few choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:25.56,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Perhaps because of\Nmy hesitant personality,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:27.77,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,I've never really been\Nable to make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:33.38,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,In first grade,\Nduring a school spring trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.42,0:10:37.13,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,I was completely left behind\Nat the campsite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:37.13,flashbacktop,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.89,0:10:41.36,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,So I had to ride a bike\Nfor dozens of kilometers just to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:49.29,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Classmates would sometimes get upset\Nif they didn't look good in their photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:54.64,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,And yet, my face couldn't even be found\Non the photo wall at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:58.00,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,At a class reunion decades later,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:11:00.19,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,I doubt anyone\Nwould even remember to invite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:02.23,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,After all, I've been forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:05.67,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Doesn't that basically mean\NI don't exist to them anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:10.90,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Anyway, ever since that spring trip,\NI started taking photos by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:13.71,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,There are so many things\NI don't want to forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.71,0:11:16.54,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,and photos are far more reliable\Nthan human memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.58,0:11:19.40,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,Looks like things\Nare wrapping up over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:21.50,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,Alright, the recycling is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.29,0:11:24.25,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,You can go back\Nto sleep for a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.63,0:11:33.00,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Bai Zhong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.00,0:11:34.57,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Did you not read the manual?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:37.35,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Stimulating the BUG Source here\Nwill severely disrupt the transmission!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:42.65,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,His memories\Nare starting to overflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:43.83,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Now we're in real trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.13,0:12:37.38,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:38.92,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,This isn't doing him any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:40.79,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,If you keep stalling like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.79,0:12:42.38,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,I'll have no choice\Nbut to destroy you on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:46.42,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,No matter how much\Nyou help him, it's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:49.75,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Besides, you've already ceased to exist\Nin the real world, No. 55.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.29,0:14:08.74,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,No. 55, this is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.26,0:14:35.39,main,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Rooftop?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:39.32,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Have I fallen asleep…\Non the rooftop again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.63,0:14:46.08,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,The weather up here is always so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.19,0:14:50.52,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Now I remember…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:54.42,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Shi Yan passed away last summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.09,0:15:00.96,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Ever since then,\Nhas everything just been my fantasy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:05.69,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Good, BUG Man recovery\Nis proceeding smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:11.54,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,No, I can't stay here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.67,0:15:15.50,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,But there's no way out from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.33,0:15:18.94,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,And even if\NI did get out, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:22.23,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Grades, being bullied,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.23,0:15:25.43,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,interacting with others,\Nmy plans for the future…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:27.17,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,I haven't figured any of it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.48,0:15:29.77,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Even if I go out,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:33.48,italics,NANZHU,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be able\Nto do anything on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:15.81,main,NANZHU,0,0,0,,Give me my camera back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:25.08,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Even the tiniest shift\Nin a person's heart
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:28.90,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,is enough to cause\Nmassive ripples across a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:31.92,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Because of this,\Nmanaging memories…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:36.08,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,is the most hazardous\Nand chaotic job in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:41.77,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,No. 55, Shi Yan…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:43.17,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Recycling complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.22,0:16:47.06,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,Hey! Boss,\Nwas I in there too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:48.38,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,No comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:51.27,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,…As a memory BUG,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.27,0:16:54.01,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,he obviously had better choices\Nhe could have made.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:56.23,top,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,So, Shi Yan's ability was\Nto blur the line between real and fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:59.08,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,Still, he was pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.82,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,To think he actually managed\Nto influence reality in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:03.73,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,Is it really okay\Nto leave it like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.15,0:17:06.76,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,Bai Zhong, you're still too green.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:11.04,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,To us, whether it's good or bad,\Ntrue or false, it's all meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:12.17,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,But never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:15.29,main,FANG TANG,0,0,0,,You've only been interning for a day,\Nand you almost ruined my perfect streak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.29,0:17:20.77,main,BAI ZHONG,0,0,0,,Ah… hehe, Boss…\Nthat's a bit too harsh!
